{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba app/content.json | sed -n '85,165p;4237,4320p;65373,65460p'\"","aggregated_output":"    85\t      \"id\": \"n1-maths-01\",\n    86\t      \"gradeband\": \"nursery1\",\n    87\t      \"subject\": \"Mathematics\",\n    88\t      \"subjectHa\": \"Lissafi\",\n    89\t      \"moduleNumber\": 1,\n    90\t      \"titleEn\": \"Counting 1–5\",\n    91\t      \"titleHa\": \"Kirgawa 1–5\",\n    92\t      \"titleAjami\": \"ﻛِرﻏَوَ ١–٥\",\n    93\t      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    94\t      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Fara da lamba ɗaya. Ka ce 'ɗaya'. Sai ka ce 'biyu'. Sai 'uku'. Sai 'huɗu'. Sai 'biyar'. Ka yi amfani da yatsun hannunka. Nuna yatsa ɗaya don 'ɗaya', yatsu biyu don 'biyu', haka zuwa biyar. Ka kuma kirga abubuwa a gida, kamar kujeru ko faranti. Alal misali, idan kana da kujeru uku, ka ce 'ɗaya, biyu, uku'. Maimaita sau da yawa. Ƙidaya tana taimaka maka sanin yawan abubuwa. Yanzu ka gwada da kanka. Ka kirga daga ɗaya zuwa biyar da babbar murya.\",\n    95\t      \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    96\t      \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin lissafi na yau. Zamu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. [MAIN] Muna fara da lamba ɗaya. Ka ce tare da ni: 'ɗaya'. Da kyau. Yanzu lamba biyu. Ka ce 'biyu'. Lamba uku. Ka ce 'uku'. Lamba huɗu. Ka ce 'huɗu'. Lamba biyar. Ka ce 'biyar'. Yanzu za mu kirga daga ɗaya zuwa biyar tare. Shirya? Fara: ɗaya, biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar. Da kyau! Ka ga yatsun hannunka? Nuna yatsa ɗaya – wannan 'ɗaya' ce. Nuna yatsu biyu – 'biyu'. Nuna uku – 'uku'. Nuna huɗu – 'huɗu'. Nuna biyar – 'biyar'. [PAUSE 1] Yanzu, ina so ka nuna mini yatsu huɗu. Ka yi shiru ka tunani. Zan tambaye ka. [PAUSE 1 question] Ci gaba. Ka kirga abubuwa a kusa da kai. [PAUSE 2] Yanzu ka saurara. Zan tambaye ka game da kirgawa. [PAUSE 2 question] [OUTRO] Aiki nagari! Yau ka koyi kirgawa ɗaya zuwa biyar. Ka maimaita a gida tare da iyayenka. Sai mun hadu a darasi na gaba.\",\n    97\t      \"audioFile\": \"audio/n1-maths-01.mp3\",\n    98\t      \"imageCard\": \"images/n1-maths-01.png\",\n    99\t      \"microPauses\": [\n   100\t        {\n   101\t          \"pauseAtMs\": 60000,\n   102\t          \"questionHa\": \"Nuna yatsu nawa don lamba huɗu?\",\n   103\t          \"correctAnswer\": \"huɗu\",\n   104\t          \"options\": [\n   105\t            \"ɗaya\",\n   106\t            \"huɗu\",\n   107\t            \"biyar\"\n   108\t          ]\n   109\t        },\n   110\t        {\n   111\t          \"pauseAtMs\": 120000,\n   112\t          \"questionHa\": \"Idan kana da kujeru biyu ka ƙara ɗaya yanzu kujera nawa?\",\n   113\t          \"correctAnswer\": \"uku\",\n   114\t          \"options\": [\n   115\t            \"biyu\",\n   116\t            \"uku\",\n   117\t            \"huɗu\"\n   118\t          ]\n   119\t        }\n   120\t      ],\n   121\t      \"quizQuestions\": [\n   122\t        {\n   123\t          \"templateHa\": \"Nawa ne {a} da {b}?\",\n   124\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a + b\",\n   125\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n   126\t            \"a\": {\n   127\t              \"min\": 1,\n   128\t              \"max\": 3\n   129\t            },\n   130\t            \"b\": {\n   131\t              \"min\": 1,\n   132\t              \"max\": 2\n   133\t            }\n   134\t          },\n   135\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n   136\t            \"a + b + 1\",\n   137\t            \"a + b - 1\",\n   138\t            \"a + b + 2\"\n   139\t          ]\n   140\t        },\n   141\t        {\n   142\t          \"templateHa\": \"Kirga daga ɗaya zuwa {a}. Lamba ta ƙarshe ita ce?\",\n   143\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a\",\n   144\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n   145\t            \"a\": {\n   146\t              \"min\": 2,\n   147\t              \"max\": 5\n   148\t            },\n   149\t            \"b\": {\n   150\t              \"min\": 0,\n   151\t              \"max\": 0\n   152\t            }\n   153\t          },\n   154\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n   155\t            \"a - 1\",\n   156\t            \"a + 1\",\n   157\t            \"a - 2\"\n   158\t          ]\n   159\t        },\n   160\t        {\n   161\t          \"templateHa\": \"Nuna yatsu {a}. Wannan lamba nawa?\",\n   162\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a\",\n   163\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n   164\t            \"a\": {\n   165\t              \"min\": 1,\n  4237\t      \"id\": \"p1-maths-01\",\n  4238\t      \"gradeband\": \"p1\",\n  4239\t      \"subject\": \"Mathematics\",\n  4240\t      \"subjectHa\": \"Lissafi\",\n  4241\t      \"moduleNumber\": 1,\n  4242\t      \"titleEn\": \"Counting 1–10\",\n  4243\t      \"titleHa\": \"Kirgawa 1–10\",\n  4244\t      \"titleAjami\": \"كِرغَوَ ١–١٠\",\n  4245\t      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n  4246\t      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa goma. Ka fara da lamba ɗaya, sa'annan biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar, shida, bakwai, takwas, tara, goma. Ka yi amfani da yatsun hannunka – nuna yatsa ɗaya don 'ɗaya', yatsu biyu don 'biyu', har zuwa goma. Ka kuma kirga abubuwa a kusa da kai, kamar litattafai, fensir, ko kujeru. Alal misali, idan kana da litattafai biyar, ka ce 'ɗaya, biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar'. Kirgawa tana taimaka maka sanin yawan abubuwa. Ka maimaita sau da yawa har sai ka koya. Yanzu ka gwada da kanka – ka kirga daga ɗaya zuwa goma da babbar murya.\",\n  4247\t      \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n  4248\t      \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Lissafi. Yau za mu koyi Kirgawa 1–10. Ka zauna lafiya, ka saurara a hankali, sannan ka maimaita bayanin da za ka ji domin ilimi ya zauna sosai a zuciyarka. [MAIN] Kirgawa daga 1 zuwa 10 yana taimaka mana mu gane yadda lambobi suke bi jere ba tare da kuskure ba. Ka fara daga 1, ka bi lambobin ɗaya bayan ɗaya har zuwa 10, kuma ka kula kada ka tsallake wata lamba ko ka maimaita lamba sau biyu. Za ka iya amfani da yatsu, litattafai, fensir, ko kujeru domin ka haɗa abin da kake faɗa da abin da kake gani a zahiri, kuma hakan yana sa koyo ya fi daɗi. A gida ko a makaranta, ka kirga mutane, kujeru, faranti, ko fensir domin ka ƙarfafa abin da ka koya yau. Ka duba abin da ke kusa da kai, ko a gida ko a aji, domin ka haɗa abin da ake faɗa da abin da kake gani ko kake yi a zahiri. Idan ka yi haka, darasin zai fi maka sauƙin fahimta. [PAUSE 1] Nuna yatsu nawa don lamba biyar? Ka dakata ka yi tunani kafin ka ci gaba. [MAIN] Ka gwada ka faɗi lambobin da babbar murya, sannan ka sake kirgawa a hankali a zuciyarka domin ka tabbatar ka tuna jeren sosai. Sanin yadda ake kirgawa da kyau yana taimaka maka a ƙari, ragewa, da sauran darussan lissafi da za ka koya daga baya. Ka tuna cewa maimaitawa yana ƙarfafa ilimi. Idan ka yi atisaye da yatsunka, da kayan aji, da abubuwan cikin gida, ko da misalai daga al'umma, za ka fi gane darasin kuma ba za ka manta da shi da wuri ba. [PAUSE 2] Kujeru bakwai, ka ƙara ɗaya – nawa? Ka sake tunani cikin natsuwa sannan ka zaɓi amsa mafi dacewa. [OUTRO] Idan ka maimaita kirgawa kullum, za ka iya gano lambobi cikin sauri kuma ka yi amfani da su cikin tabbaci. Ka ci gaba da maimaitawa, ka yi tambaya idan kana bukatar taimako, sannan mu haɗu a darasi na gaba.\",\n  4249\t      \"audioFile\": \"audio/p1-maths-01.mp3\",\n  4250\t      \"imageCard\": \"images/p1-maths-01.png\",\n  4251\t      \"microPauses\": [\n  4252\t        {\n  4253\t          \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n  4254\t          \"questionHa\": \"Nuna yatsu nawa don lamba biyar?\",\n  4255\t          \"correctAnswer\": \"biyar\",\n  4256\t          \"options\": [\n  4257\t            \"ɗaya\",\n  4258\t            \"biyar\",\n  4259\t            \"goma\"\n  4260\t          ]\n  4261\t        },\n  4262\t        {\n  4263\t          \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n  4264\t          \"questionHa\": \"Kujeru bakwai, ka ƙara ɗaya – nawa?\",\n  4265\t          \"correctAnswer\": \"takwas\",\n  4266\t          \"options\": [\n  4267\t            \"bakwai\",\n  4268\t            \"takwas\",\n  4269\t            \"tara\"\n  4270\t          ]\n  4271\t        }\n  4272\t      ],\n  4273\t      \"quizQuestions\": [\n  4274\t        {\n  4275\t          \"templateHa\": \"Nawa ne {a} da {b}?\",\n  4276\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a + b\",\n  4277\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n  4278\t            \"a\": {\n  4279\t              \"min\": 1,\n  4280\t              \"max\": 5\n  4281\t            },\n  4282\t            \"b\": {\n  4283\t              \"min\": 1,\n  4284\t              \"max\": 5\n  4285\t            }\n  4286\t          },\n  4287\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n  4288\t            \"a + b + 1\",\n  4289\t            \"a + b - 1\",\n  4290\t            \"a + b + 2\"\n  4291\t          ]\n  4292\t        },\n  4293\t        {\n  4294\t          \"templateHa\": \"Kirga daga ɗaya zuwa {a}. Lamba ta ƙarshe?\",\n  4295\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a\",\n  4296\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n  4297\t            \"a\": {\n  4298\t              \"min\": 2,\n  4299\t              \"max\": 10\n  4300\t            },\n  4301\t            \"b\": {\n  4302\t              \"min\": 0,\n  4303\t              \"max\": 0\n  4304\t            }\n  4305\t          },\n  4306\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n  4307\t            \"a - 1\",\n  4308\t            \"a + 1\",\n  4309\t            \"a + 2\"\n  4310\t          ]\n  4311\t        },\n  4312\t        {\n  4313\t          \"templateHa\": \"Nuna yatsu {a}. Wannan lamba nawa?\",\n  4314\t          \"answerFormula\": \"a\",\n  4315\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n  4316\t            \"a\": {\n  4317\t              \"min\": 1,\n  4318\t              \"max\": 10\n  4319\t            },\n  4320\t            \"b\": {\n 65373\t        {\n 65374\t          \"type\": \"glossary-card\",\n 65375\t          \"term\": {\n 65376\t            \"ha\": \"Daraja\",\n 65377\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65378\t          },\n 65379\t          \"definition\": {\n 65380\t            \"ha\": \"Abin da mutum yake ganin ya dace a kula da shi ko a ba muhimmanci.\",\n 65381\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65382\t          },\n 65383\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/falsafa/FL03-03.mp3\",\n 65384\t          \"audioScript\": \"Kalmar \\\"Daraja\\\" tana nufin abin da mutum yake ganin ya dace a kula da shi ko a ba muhimmanci.\"\n 65385\t        },\n 65386\t        {\n 65387\t          \"type\": \"example\",\n 65388\t          \"title\": {\n 65389\t            \"ha\": \"Tambayoyi uku\",\n 65390\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65391\t          },\n 65392\t          \"scenario\": {\n 65393\t            \"ha\": \"An tambayi mai kula ko zai samu zuwa da yamma, an fayyace lokacin yamma, sannan aka saurari abin da kowa ya fi damuwa da shi.\",\n 65394\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65395\t          },\n 65396\t          \"takeaway\": {\n 65397\t            \"ha\": \"Raba tambayoyin ya nuna ko ana neman bayani, ma'ana, ko ana bayyana abin da ya fi muhimmanci.\",\n 65398\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65399\t          },\n 65400\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/falsafa/FL03-04.mp3\",\n 65401\t          \"audioScript\": \"Ga tambayoyi uku. An tambayi mai kula ko zai samu zuwa da yamma, an fayyace lokacin yamma, sannan aka saurari abin da kowa ya fi damuwa da shi. Abin da wannan ya nuna shi ne, raba tambayoyin ya nuna ko ana neman bayani, ma'ana, ko ana bayyana abin da ya fi muhimmanci.\"\n 65402\t        },\n 65403\t        {\n 65404\t          \"type\": \"prose\",\n 65405\t          \"heading\": {\n 65406\t            \"ha\": \"Kada a gauraya su\",\n 65407\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65408\t          },\n 65409\t          \"body\": {\n 65410\t            \"ha\": \"Idan ka gane irin saɓani, za ka san wace tambaya ce ta dace maimakon ka yi zance a fili ba tare da tsari ba.\",\n 65411\t            \"ajami\": null\n 65412\t          },\n 65413\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/falsafa/FL03-05.mp3\",\n 65414\t          \"audioScript\": \"Kada a gauraya su. Idan ka gane irin saɓani, za ka san wace tambaya ce ta dace maimakon ka yi zance a fili ba tare da tsari ba.\"\n 65415\t        }\n 65416\t      ],\n 65417\t      \"microPauses\": [],\n 65418\t      \"passingScore\": 3,\n 65419\t      \"quiz\": [\n 65420\t        {\n 65421\t          \"templateHa\": \"'Mai kula zai iya zuwa da yamma' wane irin tambaya ce?\",\n 65422\t          \"answerFormula\": \"Tambaya kan abin da za a iya dubawa\",\n 65423\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n 65424\t            \"a\": {\n 65425\t              \"min\": 0,\n 65426\t              \"max\": 0\n 65427\t            },\n 65428\t            \"b\": {\n 65429\t              \"min\": 0,\n 65430\t              \"max\": 0\n 65431\t            }\n 65432\t          },\n 65433\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n 65434\t            \"Tambaya kan abin da wani ya fi darajantawa\",\n 65435\t            \"Tambaya kan darajar mutum\",\n 65436\t            \"Tambaya kan salo na magana\"\n 65437\t          ]\n 65438\t        },\n 65439\t        {\n 65440\t          \"templateHa\": \"'Yamma tana farawa daga ƙarfe nawa?' saɓani ne kan me?\",\n 65441\t          \"answerFormula\": \"Ma'anar kalmar yamma\",\n 65442\t          \"variableRanges\": {\n 65443\t            \"a\": {\n 65444\t              \"min\": 0,\n 65445\t              \"max\": 0\n 65446\t            },\n 65447\t            \"b\": {\n 65448\t              \"min\": 0,\n 65449\t              \"max\": 0\n 65450\t            }\n 65451\t          },\n 65452\t          \"distractorFormulas\": [\n 65453\t            \"Yawan littattafai\",\n 65454\t            \"Abin da ya faru jiya\",\n 65455\t            \"Darajar abota\"\n 65456\t          ]\n 65457\t        },\n 65458\t        {\n 65459\t          \"templateHa\": \"Hauwa ta fi damuwa da damar karatu, Sani kuma da lokacin iyali. Wannan saɓani ne kan me?\",\n 65460\t          \"answerFormula\": \"Abin da kowanne ya fi ba muhimmanci\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
