{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"grep -n '\\\"segments\\\"' app/content.json | head -n 4\nnl -ba app/content.json | sed -n '218,257p;4197,4236p;4369,4409p'\"","aggregated_output":"224:      \"segments\": [\n397:      \"segments\": [\n570:      \"segments\": [\n743:      \"segments\": [\n   218\t      \"track\": \"formal\",\n   219\t      \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n   220\t      \"gapTeaser\": null,\n   221\t      \"chainNext\": null,\n   222\t      \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n   223\t      \"useTodayPrompt\": null,\n   224\t      \"segments\": [\n   225\t        {\n   226\t          \"index\": 1,\n   227\t          \"audioScript\": \"Sannu da zuwa darasin lissafi na yau. Zamu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Muna fara da lamba ɗaya. Ka ce tare da ni: 'ɗaya'. Da kyau. Yanzu lamba biyu. Ka ce 'biyu'. Lamba uku. Ka ce 'uku'. Lamba huɗu. Ka ce 'huɗu'. Lamba biyar. Ka ce 'biyar'. Yanzu za mu kirga daga ɗaya zuwa biyar tare. Shirya? Fara: ɗaya, biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar. Da kyau! Ka ga yatsun hannunka? Nuna yatsa ɗaya – wannan 'ɗaya' ce. Nuna yatsu biyu – 'biyu'. Nuna uku – 'uku'. Nuna huɗu – 'huɗu'. Nuna biyar – 'biyar'. Yanzu, ina so ka nuna mini yatsu huɗu. Ka yi shiru ka tunani. Zan tambaye ka.\",\n   228\t          \"text\": {\n   229\t            \"ha\": \"Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Fara da lamba ɗaya. Ka ce 'ɗaya'. Sai ka ce 'biyu'. Sai 'uku'. Sai 'huɗu'. Sai 'biyar'. Ka yi amfani da yatsun hannunka. Nuna yatsa ɗaya don 'ɗaya', yatsu biyu don 'biyu', haka zuwa biyar. Ka kuma kirga abubuwa a gida, kamar kujeru ko faranti. Alal misali, idan kana da kujeru uku, ka ce 'ɗaya, biyu, uku'. \",\n   230\t            \"ajami\": null\n   231\t          },\n   232\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n1-maths-01-01.mp3\",\n   233\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n   234\t        },\n   235\t        {\n   236\t          \"index\": 2,\n   237\t          \"audioScript\": \"Ci gaba. Ka kirga abubuwa a kusa da kai. Yanzu ka saurara. Zan tambaye ka game da kirgawa.\",\n   238\t          \"text\": {\n   239\t            \"ha\": \"Maimaita sau da yawa. Ƙidaya tana taimaka maka sanin yawan abubuwa. \",\n   240\t            \"ajami\": null\n   241\t          },\n   242\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n1-maths-01-02.mp3\",\n   243\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n   244\t        },\n   245\t        {\n   246\t          \"index\": 3,\n   247\t          \"audioScript\": \"Aiki nagari! Yau ka koyi kirgawa ɗaya zuwa biyar. Ka maimaita a gida tare da iyayenka. Sai mun hadu a darasi na gaba.\",\n   248\t          \"text\": {\n   249\t            \"ha\": \"Yanzu ka gwada da kanka. Ka kirga daga ɗaya zuwa biyar da babbar murya.\",\n   250\t            \"ajami\": null\n   251\t          },\n   252\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n1-maths-01-03.mp3\",\n   253\t          \"gate\": null\n   254\t        }\n   255\t      ]\n   256\t    },\n   257\t    {\n  4197\t      \"track\": \"formal\",\n  4198\t      \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n  4199\t      \"gapTeaser\": null,\n  4200\t      \"chainNext\": null,\n  4201\t      \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n  4202\t      \"useTodayPrompt\": null,\n  4203\t      \"segments\": [\n  4204\t        {\n  4205\t          \"index\": 1,\n  4206\t          \"audioScript\": \"Yau zamu maimaita duk darasin Nursery 2. Ka kirga 1-20. Ka ce 5+3. Ka ce 7-2. Ka nuna cikawa. Ka ce tsarin lambobi bayan 10. Tambaya: 8+2 nawa?\",\n  4207\t          \"text\": {\n  4208\t            \"ha\": \"Wannan darasi na maimaita duk abin da muka koya a Nursery 2: kirgawa 1-20, rubuta, nauyi/sauki, kan/ƙarƙashin, ƙari, ragewa, rarraba da launi, cikawa/fanko, tsarin lambobi, da kalmomi. \",\n  4209\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4210\t          },\n  4211\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n2-maths-12-01.mp3\",\n  4212\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n  4213\t        },\n  4214\t        {\n  4215\t          \"index\": 2,\n  4216\t          \"audioScript\": \"Ci gaba. Ka ce nauyi. Ka nuna kan. Tambaya ta ƙarshe: 15-5 nawa?\",\n  4217\t          \"text\": {\n  4218\t            \"ha\": \"Ka amsa tambayoyi. \",\n  4219\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4220\t          },\n  4221\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n2-maths-12-02.mp3\",\n  4222\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n  4223\t        },\n  4224\t        {\n  4225\t          \"index\": 3,\n  4226\t          \"audioScript\": \"Taya murna! Ka kammala Nursery 2.\",\n  4227\t          \"text\": {\n  4228\t            \"ha\": \"Ka yi bikin kammalawa!\",\n  4229\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4230\t          },\n  4231\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/n2-maths-12-03.mp3\",\n  4232\t          \"gate\": null\n  4233\t        }\n  4234\t      ]\n  4235\t    },\n  4236\t    {\n  4369\t      ],\n  4370\t      \"track\": \"formal\",\n  4371\t      \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n  4372\t      \"gapTeaser\": null,\n  4373\t      \"chainNext\": null,\n  4374\t      \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n  4375\t      \"useTodayPrompt\": null,\n  4376\t      \"segments\": [\n  4377\t        {\n  4378\t          \"index\": 1,\n  4379\t          \"audioScript\": \"Sannu da zuwa darasin Lissafi. Yau za mu koyi Kirgawa 1–10. Ka zauna lafiya, ka saurara a hankali, sannan ka maimaita bayanin da za ka ji domin ilimi ya zauna sosai a zuciyarka. Kirgawa daga 1 zuwa 10 yana taimaka mana mu gane yadda lambobi suke bi jere ba tare da kuskure ba. Ka fara daga 1, ka bi lambobin ɗaya bayan ɗaya har zuwa 10, kuma ka kula kada ka tsallake wata lamba ko ka maimaita lamba sau biyu. Za ka iya amfani da yatsu, litattafai, fensir, ko kujeru domin ka haɗa abin da kake faɗa da abin da kake gani a zahiri, kuma hakan yana sa koyo ya fi daɗi. A gida ko a makaranta, ka kirga mutane, kujeru, faranti, ko fensir domin ka ƙarfafa abin da ka koya yau. Ka duba abin da ke kusa da kai, ko a gida ko a aji, domin ka haɗa abin da ake faɗa da abin da kake gani ko kake yi a zahiri. Idan ka yi haka, darasin zai fi maka sauƙin fahimta. Nuna yatsu nawa don lamba biyar? Ka dakata ka yi tunani kafin ka ci gaba.\",\n  4380\t          \"text\": {\n  4381\t            \"ha\": \"Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa goma. Ka fara da lamba ɗaya, sa'annan biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar, shida, bakwai, takwas, tara, goma. Ka yi amfani da yatsun hannunka – nuna yatsa ɗaya don 'ɗaya', yatsu biyu don 'biyu', har zuwa goma. Ka kuma kirga abubuwa a kusa da kai, kamar litattafai, fensir, ko kujeru. \",\n  4382\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4383\t          },\n  4384\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/p1-maths-01-01.mp3\",\n  4385\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n  4386\t        },\n  4387\t        {\n  4388\t          \"index\": 2,\n  4389\t          \"audioScript\": \"Ka gwada ka faɗi lambobin da babbar murya, sannan ka sake kirgawa a hankali a zuciyarka domin ka tabbatar ka tuna jeren sosai. Sanin yadda ake kirgawa da kyau yana taimaka maka a ƙari, ragewa, da sauran darussan lissafi da za ka koya daga baya. Ka tuna cewa maimaitawa yana ƙarfafa ilimi. Idan ka yi atisaye da yatsunka, da kayan aji, da abubuwan cikin gida, ko da misalai daga al'umma, za ka fi gane darasin kuma ba za ka manta da shi da wuri ba. Kujeru bakwai, ka ƙara ɗaya – nawa? Ka sake tunani cikin natsuwa sannan ka zaɓi amsa mafi dacewa.\",\n  4390\t          \"text\": {\n  4391\t            \"ha\": \"Alal misali, idan kana da litattafai biyar, ka ce 'ɗaya, biyu, uku, huɗu, biyar'. Kirgawa tana taimaka maka sanin yawan abubuwa. Ka maimaita sau da yawa har sai ka koya. \",\n  4392\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4393\t          },\n  4394\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/p1-maths-01-02.mp3\",\n  4395\t          \"gate\": \"quiz\"\n  4396\t        },\n  4397\t        {\n  4398\t          \"index\": 3,\n  4399\t          \"audioScript\": \"Idan ka maimaita kirgawa kullum, za ka iya gano lambobi cikin sauri kuma ka yi amfani da su cikin tabbaci. Ka ci gaba da maimaitawa, ka yi tambaya idan kana bukatar taimako, sannan mu haɗu a darasi na gaba.\",\n  4400\t          \"text\": {\n  4401\t            \"ha\": \"Yanzu ka gwada da kanka – ka kirga daga ɗaya zuwa goma da babbar murya.\",\n  4402\t            \"ajami\": null\n  4403\t          },\n  4404\t          \"audioFile\": \"audio/p1-maths-01-03.mp3\",\n  4405\t          \"gate\": null\n  4406\t        }\n  4407\t      ]\n  4408\t    },\n  4409\t    {\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
